# Locked Params

**Rule 0 first:** read the production source before proposing any change to the
files below (CLAUDE.md; `docs/rule_0.md`).

## Pine (`**/*.pine`) — LOCKED parameter axis

- SL/TP/ATR/risk%/pyramid/session/BE/trail are **immutable**. Pine is canonical
  for strategy behavior and is gitignored + hash-pinned
  (`core/strategies/MANIFEST.sha256`).
- A real parameter change needs a **lock ADR + re-MC**, never an inline edit.
  Decay authorizes reversible de-risk (lifecycle multiplier), not re-fitting.

## Sizing constants (`firm_rules.py`, `dd_protection.py`)

- `DD_TRIGGER` / `DD_SCALE` / `BASE_RISK` / `_BASE_RISK` are frozen. The historical
  MC calibration 99.83/0.17/4.37 is recorded in `docs/mc_anchor_history.md`;
  engine regression is pinned by `tests/core/test_mc_synthetic_engine.py`
  (substrate Phase 3 retired the Pepperstone executable pin 2026-07-24).
- Changing any of them requires a **lock decision brief + vendor-free engine
  regression** (`tests/core/test_mc_synthetic_engine.py`) and the change-control
  in `docs/adr/2026-05-08-dd-trigger-c2-relock.md` (DD tier). The Pepperstone
  `portfolio_mc` CLI pin is retired — do not treat `python portfolio_mc.py` as
  the re-MC.
  (`RISK_TIERS` / `BASELINE_RISK` were multiplier-spine aliases removed in
  substrate Phase 2 — do not reintroduce without a new ADR.)

## Vendor data (`core/data/{tv_exports,bar_data,external}/**`)

- After changing any CSV, regenerate the manifest and commit the `SHA256SUMS`
  delta **in the same commit**:
  `python scripts/check_data_manifests.py --regenerate` (dry-run first).
- The pre-commit hook blocks on a stale manifest; CI can't re-hash gitignored
  bytes, so the local hook is the only gate (lesson M-9).

The former derived mirror `core/config/params.toml` and its hub gate
(`validate_params.py`) were **retired 2026-08-03**
([`docs/adr/2026-08-03-params-toml-gate-retirement.md`](docs/adr/2026-08-03-params-toml-gate-retirement.md)).
Surviving integrity: `check_pine_manifest`, path-liveness (MANIFEST parents),
`check_skills_no_constants`, `verify_lock_anchors` (dd_protection-only).
